SUMMARY:Wilder Series: The Provoking Lake Loop
DESCRIPTION:Wilderness Union Toronto - Outdoor Adventure and Hiking Club\n
 **Please note the only way to register for this adventure is on [our websi
 te.](https://www.wildernessunion.com/adventures/provoking-lake)**\n\n**Mos
 t people take two days to walk around Provoking Lake. We are doing it in o
 ne.**\n\nThis one's part of our Wilder series\, our lineup of challenging 
 adventures for those chasing bigger\, more grueling and more rewarding day
 s out.\n\nWe’ll be taking on Loop 1 of the Algonquin's Highland Backpack
 ing Trail\, The trail circles Provoking Lake through classic Algonquin for
 est\, roots\, rock\, and enough elevation change to keep your attention th
 e whole way around\, covering 21.5km by the time we're back at the car.\n\
 nYou will pass a couple of lookouts over the lake and the surrounding hill
 s\, and long stretches where the loudest thing around is a woodpecker or y
 our own footsteps. Backcountry campsites dot the shoreline the whole way a
 round\, a quiet preview of what a multi-day trip on this trail could look 
 like down the road.\n\nTwenty one kilometres of Algonquin backcountry\, do
 ne in a day. Are you up for it?\n\n**Due to increased demand for daily veh
 icle permits in fall\, all members will be required to take our transport 
 for this adventure. The cost of transport is included in the cost of this 
 adventure.**\n‍\n**Accessibility**\nWilderness Union is committed to mak
 ing our adventures as accessible as possible. If you wish to make an accom
 modation request relating to a disability or provide feedback\, please do 
 so by sending an email to [info@wildernessunion.com](mailto:info@wildernes
 sunion.com)\n\n**Highlights**\n**Provoking Lake Lookouts:** A couple of cl
 earings along the loop open up over the lake and the surrounding hills.\n*
 *A Real Physical Test:** 21km and over 800 metres of climbing in a single 
 day. Come ready to work for it.\n**Wildlife Country:** Moose and loons are
  regulars around Provoking Lake\, keep your eyes open.\n\n**Event cost: $1
 30+HST (for explorer members)**\n**Register [here.](https://www.wilderness
 union.com/adventures/provoking-lake)**\n\n**About Wilderness Union**\nWild
 erness Union is deliberate about building an outdoors community that conne
 cts you to the life-changing magic of the outdoors and helps you find your
  people.\n\nMembers range from 20-40 years old. The group is a mix of GTA 
 locals and newcomers to Toronto from within Canada and abroad.\n\nAttendan
 ce numbers on Meetup don't reflect our actual event attendance - we typica
 lly have 15-20 community members at each event. Large enough that there's 
 someone new to meet but small enough that it's not overwhelming!\n\n***Lea
 rn more at our website [www.wildernessunion.com](https://www.wildernessuni
 on.com/)***
